<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/34/eng@/~cl_12> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 30 the following section: “Limitation on contracts 30a. The Commission shall not, without the approval of the Minister and the concurrence of the Minister of Finance, enter into any contract under which the Commission is to pay or receive an amount exceeding ten million ringgit.”. Amendment of section 33"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/34/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/34/eng@/~cl_13> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/34/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/34/eng@> .
