<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/34/eng@/~cl_14> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by deleting section 34. Saving"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/34/eng@> .
