<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/34/eng@/~cl_7> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 17 the following section: “Restriction on the use of the symbol or representation of the Commission 17a. (1) The Commission shall have the exclusive right to the use of such symbol or representation as the Commission may select or devise and thereafter display or exhibit in connection with its activities or affairs. (2) The symbol or representation selected or devised by the Commission shall be published in the Gazette. (3) Any person who uses a symbol or representation of the Commission or any resemblance thereof, or creates any symbol or representation which refers to the Commission so as to deceive or cause confusion, or to be likely to deceive or to cause confusion, commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding three hundred thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding three years or to both.”. Amendment of section 18"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/34/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/34/eng@/~cl_8> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/34/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/34/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/34/eng@/~cl_8> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "8" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/34/eng@> .
